      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate</code></a> for the given <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> 以及 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the discovered repositories in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>中注册已发现的仓库。",
      "count": 2
    },
