      "source": "Delegate for configuration integration to reuse the general way of detecting repositories. Customization is done by\nproviding a configuration format specific <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a> (currently either XML or annotations\nare supported). The actual registration can then be triggered for different <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>\ns.",
      "translation": "委托配置集成以复用通用的仓库检测方式。自定义通过提供特定的<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a>配置格式来实现（当前支持 XML 或注解）。随后，可以针对不同的<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>触发实际的注册。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registry</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a> in which to register the repository bean.",
      "translation": "<code>registry</code> - 用于注册仓库 Bean 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>extension</code> - <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a> for the module.",
      "translation": "<code>extension</code> - 模块的<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.config 中的接口\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/parsing/BeanComponentDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.parsing\"><code>BeanComponentDefinition</code></a>s for all repository bean definitions found.",
      "translation": "为所有发现的存储库 Bean 定义查找<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/parsing/BeanComponentDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.parsing\"><code>BeanComponentDefinition</code></a>。",
